If Windy is taller than Michael, it doesn't necessarily tell us anything about whether Windy jumps when shooting or if she is a great shooter. However, if Windy jumps when shooting, then according to the information provided, "Every shooter who can jump when shooting is a great shooter," Windy would be a great shooter.

