Assume that Greyhound is not an airline. According to the fifth piece of information, if Greyhound is not an airline, then there are no Greyhound planes.

However, the information does not provide any direct information about whether Greyhound is an airline or not. It only gives us a conditional statement about what happens if Greyhound is not an airline.

