Therefore, the ability to block Windy's shooting depends on whether jumping makes the shot unblockable regardless of the height difference.

Since the information states that Michael cannot block Windy's shooting because she jumps, and there's no indication that Peter has any special ability beyond his height to counteract the jumping, it follows that Peter would also likely be unable to block Windy's shooting if she jumps.

Thus, the statement "Peter can block Windy's shooting" is false because Windy jumps when shooting, and jumping makes the shot unblockable, even for someone taller like Peter.

