Additionally, since reinforcement learning is explicitly ruled out and unsupervised learning doesn't require labelled data (and thus is also ruled out given the requirement for labelled data), the only remaining option that fits the requirement of needing labelled data is supervised learning.

Therefore, the statement "Supervised learning is used to train the state-of-the-art text summarization model" is consistent with the information provided.

